window.docContents[219].resolve({"/AppendixApiReference/#appendix-api-synthinstance":{"contents":"* 签名: Expr → MetaM (Option Expr) / Expr → MetaM Expr* 用途: 搜索 type class（类型类，Lean 的自动实例推断机制）实例；synthInstance? 失败时返回 none，synthInstance 失败时直接报错\n\n示例：\n\n-- 推荐：先用 synthInstance?，可以优雅地处理搜索失败\nmatch ← synthInstance? (← mkAppM ``Inhabited #[α]) with\n| some inst => logInfo m!\"found: {inst}\"\n| none      => throwError \"no Inhabited instance for {α}\"\n\n-- 也可以查找 OfNat 实例\nlet inst ← synthInstance (← mkAppM ``OfNat #[mkConst ``Nat, mkNatLit 0])\n\n\n* 注意: 推荐优先使用 synthInstance?，它让你能在搜索失败时给出更好的错误信息，而不是直接抛出内部错误* 推荐掌握时机: Ch05 后* 出现章节: Ch05\n\n","context":"Lean 4 自动化内幕\u0009附录 A：Metaprogramming API 速查表\u0009A.2 MetaM 层","header":"27.3.13. synthInstance?  /  synthInstance","id":"/AppendixApiReference/#appendix-api-synthinstance"},"/Ch04GoalManagement/#exercises":{"contents":"\n\n\n\n\n\n","context":"Lean 4 自动化内幕\u0009目标管理","header":"6.9. 4.8 练习","id":"/Ch04GoalManagement/#exercises"}});